OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of mainly light rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle, however some brighter or
OL,8,Fsunnier spells are expected across
OL,9,Fnorthern counties at times, especially
OL,10,Fthrough the morning. Mainly light
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA few clearer spells across
OL,14,Fnorthern and western parts, especially
OL,15,Fthrough the evening, but generally a
OL,16,Fcloudy night with outbreaks of mainly
OL,17,Flight rain. Winds continue light and
OL,18,Fvariable.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
