OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cloudy start with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, the rain slowly
OL,7,Fdying out with some brighter or
OL,8,Fsunnier spells developing in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,12,Fcloudy with a little rain at times
OL,13,FSunday. Mainly dry Monday with some
OL,14,Fsunny spells. Then a bright start
OL,15,FTuesday but cloudier with rain later
OL,16,Fand freshening southeasterly winds.
